Ícones adaptados do Lucide (https://lucide.dev), v0.27.0 da componentes-ui:
activity, bug, git-branch, git-merge, robot (bot), broadcast (radio), webhook,
tree-structure (network), signpost, stack (layers), brackets-curly (braces),
file-code, file-csv (file-spreadsheet), hard-drives (hard-drive), gauge, compass.
Redesenhados no formato do conjunto (viewBox 24, traço 2, pontas redondas, arcos
em sintaxe curta), sem cor fixa.

